  "notes": "Warm cream paper background with navy primary and a dark navy bottom player bar. Signature element: proportional 'actual vs planned' stop bar with diagonal red hatching for overrun, orange bookmark ticks and a playhead, plus a generated insight sentence ('Stop 4 ran +19:45 … 89% of the overrun') with jump link. Waveform colours speakers (navy Inês, green Guest, beige walking/quiet) and dims played vs unplayed. Monospace timecodes everywhere are clickable to seek. Bookmarks appear both as amber inline chips in the transcript and as editable list items whose type can be switched to cut start/end. Keyboard shortcut legend rendered as kbd chips in sidebar. Up next queue opens as a popover above the player with move up/down and remove controls."
